      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, thanks for the help... i'm just so shaken up. it feels so intentional. like, why the calorie-restricted menu right when i'm already stressed? and the payroll thing... it's like they're trying to make me feel unstable or something. do you think these are actually tactics? like, is there a specific way companies try to push people out mentally before they actually fire them? i feel like i'm being systematically broken down.",
